{"abstract":"Denne rapport præsenterer resultaterne af evalueringen og dokumentationen af ASTE Coding Class modulet (2017-2018). Initiativet til modulet, samt evalueringen og dokumentationen af ASTE Coding Class, er igangsat af IT-Branchen i samarbejde med Institut for læreruddannelse ved Københavns Professionshøjskole.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Hansbøl, Mikala","Tamborg, Andreas Lindenskov","Exner, Martin"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-081710"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Computational thinking","Faglighed","Folkeskole","Grundskole","Teknologi","Teknologiforståelse","Undervisning"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-UC-KP"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"læreruddannelsen får kodning på skemaet aste coding class hovedrapport dokumentation og evaluering","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Andet","type":"rem","url":"https://itb.dk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/aste-coding-class-rapport-291018.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-081710","ids":["aau-6cdc8f8a-a147-4563-9c4f-e5407aa3536e"],"keyword":["ASTE Coding Class","computational thinking","conputationel tænkning","faglighed","folkeskole","grundskole","kompetenceområder","teknologi","teknologiforståelse","undervisning","undervisningsministeriet"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-AEF37C915D595905FE400DC1F65DB888"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Andet","type":"rem","url":"https://itb.dk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/aste-coding-class-rapport-291018.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-