{"abstract":"Kapitlet rejser spørgsmålene: Hvem er MOOC deltagerne? Med hvilke formål tilmelder deltagerne sig en MOOC, og hvilke læringsmuligheder og udfordringer møder MOOC deltagerne i en MOOC? Udover et blik for MOOC deltagernes forskellige interesser, forudsætninger og formål med MOOC deltagelse, fremhæver artiklen designprincipper med særligt blik for læringsformer, interaktion, metakommunikation, deltagerforudsætninger og læringsveje, som et særligt centralt aspekt i arbejdet med at designe for læring gennem deltagelse i MOOCs.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Hansbøl, Mikala"],"cuid":["S02-093.94-038986"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["MOOCs","Massive Open Online Course","internetbaserede uddannelser","uddannelsesdesign"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-UCL"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-UCL"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mooc deltagere interaktioner og læringsmuligheder","src":["kp","ucl"],"src-code":["DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-UCL"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S02-093.94-038986","ids":["kp-6de71844-3ad4-4a8c-b042-871117f5ef92","ucl-15bd5b1e-dbd2-45b3-ac2a-f1f0c82d36de"],"keyword":["MOOCs","Massive Open Online Course","internetbaserede uddannelser","uddannelsesdesign"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-2-B476227AA2E26CA6906B6F621E525B20"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Professionshøjskole, Institut for Skole og Læring","Professionshøjskolen Metropol (ophørt), Læreruddannelserne (ophørt)"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ucl university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCL","l3nl":"UCL University College","l3nn":"UCL University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCL University College","namevar":["UCL Erhvervsakademi og Professionshøjskole, Direktion, Pædagogik og Samfund, Anvendt Forskning i Pædagogik og Samfund"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCL","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Mikala","key":"hansbølpau","last":"Hansbøl","locid":"d6c31864-454c-45f2-80ba-4b84b549193b","name":"Hansbøl, Mikala","orcid":"0000-0001-8661-1037","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Anne-Mette","key":"nortvigpedh","last":"Nortvig","name":"Nortvig, Anne-Mette","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Astrid Margrethe","key":"hestbechpedh","last":"Hestbech","name":"Hestbech, Astrid Margrethe","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788771603316"],"issn":["22463259"],"pages":"87-100","place":"Frederikshavn","publisher":"Dafolo","series":"Undervisning og Læring","status":"p","subtitle":"MOOCs - massive open online courses","title":"Nye design for undervisning og uddannelse"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","KP","UCL University College","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["kp-6de71844-3ad4-4a8c-b042-871117f5ef92","ucl-15bd5b1e-dbd2-45b3-ac2a-f1f0c82d36de"],"src":["KP University College Copenhagen","UCL University College"],"title":"MOOC deltagere : interaktioner og læringsmuligheder","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-093.94-038986","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Since the turn of the century the phenomenon of learning has received increasingly more attention. Within the theoretical field, a variety of theories of learning have evolved. The field of research on learning has become very complex, with different foci, founders and proponents, schools, and disciplinary approaches. This book is a first publication in the ‘On the definition of learning’ network. The network arose out of the aspiration to study the phenomenon of learning in depth and to understand its complex relationship to empirical investigation and teaching. Based on the assumption that it is important to be sensitive to the variety of concepts and theories of learning in the field, and to continue to cultivate that variety, the book takes a step towards actively and critically engaging the various approaches in the field of learning theory. At the same time it emphasizes the complex relationships that exist between conceptualizations of learning and the empirical phenomenon of learning and teaching. It discusses how conceptualizations of learning are put to work in educational contexts and how the normative aspects of learning in relation to discussions of what is considered worth learning influence the formative processes of human development.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Qvortrup, Ane","Wiberg, Merete","Christensen, Gerd","Hansbøl, Mikala"],"cuid":["S03-100.00-017929"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"keyword":["Definition of learning","Didaktik","Faculty of Humanities","Learning","Læring","Pædagogisk filosofi","Undervisning","learning educational science and teaching","læringsbegreber"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU","DI-UC-KP"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"on the definition of learning","src":["au","kp","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-UC-KP"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://www.sdu.dk/en/om_sdu/institutter_centre/ikv/forskning/forskningsprojekter/on+the+definition+of+learning/publikationer","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S03-100.00-017929","ids":["au-488a6829-2b3b-4f40-bf18-b5c5ff211dcc","kp-2905e8c2-30b0-4ca0-8675-494c6c1e7d6c","ku-4e7ca570-00db-4a78-97f1-9c377dd58cb7"],"keyword":["Definition of learning","Faculty of Humanities","Learning","Læring","didaktik","learning, educational science and teaching","læringsbegreber","pædagogisk filosofi","undervisning"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-3-A811D7FFCAFF0184D98222C0F433BFB0"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://www.sdu.dk/en/om_sdu/institutter_centre/ikv/forskning/forskningsprojekter/on+the+definition+of+learning/publikationer","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Professionshøjskole, Institut for Skole og Læring","Professionshøjskolen Metropol (ophørt), Læreruddannelserne (ophørt)"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU