rete","key":"wibergpau","last":"Wiberg","locid":"ddbdf79e-fd09-4603-8af2-b570c141f154","name":"Wiberg, Merete","orcid":"0000-0001-7218-3377","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ane","key":"qvortruppedh","last":"Qvortrup","name":"Qvortrup, Ane","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Merete","key":"wibergpedh","last":"Wiberg","name":"Wiberg, Merete","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Gerd","key":"christensenpedh","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Gerd","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Mikala","key":"hansbølpedh","last":"Hansbøl","name":"Hansbøl, Mikala","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788776748760"],"pages":"323-336","place":"Odense","publisher":"Syddansk Universitetsforlag","status":"p","title":"On the Definition of Learning"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-40f5a62d-a94c-4c4d-8fab-4e6caf3f8d51","sdu-f24c58e4-13cf-430e-abe7-9e2b3704fc7d"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"An Interview with Anna Sfard","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-017422","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"The aim of this paper is to discuss the theoretical and philosophical fundament of Jean Lave & Etienne Wenger’s theory of ’situated learning’. In Denmark, the theory has been categorized under as different paradigms as a theory of learning as ‘apprenticeship’ and as ‘social constructionism’. This may seem as a theoretical discussion without any implications for an actual practice. But, as it will be argued in the paper, the perception of the theory has fundamental consequences for how it is considered to contribute to the understanding of learning and to analyses of learning in an actual context. The paper can, thus, be considered as not only a contribution to a narrow discussion of ‘situated learning’, but also to the wider discussion of how to conceptualize ‘learning’ as such. In addition, the paper discusses some of the analytical perspectives, which are at stake in some of the other papers in this anthology. While Klaus Nielsen uses Lave & Wenger’s theory for his analysis, Ane Qvortrup and Tina Bering Keiding analyze its impact (p. XX & XX in this volume). And while Helle Plauborg uses Karen Barads approach for her analyses, Steen Bech analyses the theory of Vygotsky, which is also mentioned in this paper.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Christensen, Gerd"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-518289"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Faculty of Humanities"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"situated learning beyond apprenticeship and social constructionism","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-518289","ids":["ku-d0f509b5-17ab-4cfb-8881-d63d19feb607"],"keyword":["Faculty of Humanities","Lave & Wenger, situeret læring, mesterlære, socialkonstruktionisme"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-82D5034941EB7A09ADDAE16C8E8C9F93"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Communication"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Gerd","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"fc0531cc-5d3d-4af3-8226-c5d39f2b81e7","name":"Christensen, Gerd","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ane","key":"qvortruppedh","last":"Qvortrup","name":"Qvortrup, Ane","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Merete","key":"wibergpedh","last":"Wiberg","name":"Wiberg, Merete","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Gerd","key":"christensenpedh","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Gerd","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Mikala","key":"hansbølpedh","last":"Hansbøl","name":"Hansbøl, Mikala","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788776748760"],"pages":"125-140","place":"Odense","publisher":"Syddansk Universitetsforlag","status":"p","title":"On the Definition of Learning"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-d0f509b5-17ab-4cfb-8881-d63d19feb607"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Situated learning - beyond apprenticeship and social constructionism","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-518289","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Since the turn of the century the phenomenon of learning has received increasingly more attention. Within the theoretical field, a variety of theories of learning have evolved. The field of research on learning has become very complex, with different foci, founders and proponents, schools, and disciplinary approaches. This book is a first publication in the ‘On the definition of learning’ network. The network arose out of the aspiration to study the phenomenon of learning in depth and to understand its complex relationship to empirical investigation and teaching. Based on the assumption that it is important to be sensitive to the variety of concepts and theories of learning in the field, and to continue to cultivate that variety, the book takes a step towards actively and critically engaging the various approaches in the field of learning theory. At the same time it emphasizes the complex relationships that exist between conceptualizations of learning and the empirical phenomenon of learning and teaching. It discusses how conceptualizations of learning are put to work in educational contexts and how the normative aspects of learning in relation to discussions of what is considered worth learning influence the formative processes of human development.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Qvortrup, Ane","Wiberg, Merete","Christensen, Gerd","Hansbøl, Mikala"],"cuid":["S02-096.30-029957"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Læring","learning educational science and teaching","læringsbegreber"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU","DI-UC-KP"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"introduction","src":["au","kp"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-UC-KP"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.sdu.dk/en/om_sdu/institutter_centre/ikv/forskning/forskningsprojekter/on+the+definition+of+learning/publikationer","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-096.30-029957","ids":["au-ee82036d-a8ad-41e7-862c-af9f7ced601f","kp-640d52fd-466e-4098-b098-7d751dbeae9e"],"keyword":["Læring","learning, educational science and teaching","læringsbegreber"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-2-4DFBB863D2EC23BEF2B963807A121C10"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.sdu.dk/en/om_sdu/institutter_centre/ikv/forskning/forskningsprojekter/on+the+definition+of+learning/publikationer","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["University of Southern Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Philosophy of Education, Aarhus"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen Metropol (ophørt), Læreruddannelserne (ophørt)"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ane","key":"qvortruppau","last":"Qvortrup","name":"Qvortrup, Ane","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Merete","key":"wibergpau","last":"Wiberg","locid":"ddbdf79e-fd09-4603-8af2-b570c141f154","name":"Wiberg, Merete","orcid":"0000-0001-7218-3377","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Gerd","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Gerd","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Mikala","key":"hansbølpau","last":"Hansbøl","locid":"d6c31864-454c-45f2-80ba-4b84b549193b","name":"Hansbøl, Mikala","orcid":"0000-0001-8661-1037","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ane","key":"qvortruppedh","last":"Qvortrup","name":"Qvortrup, Ane","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Merete","key":"wibergpedh","last":"Wiberg","name":"Wiberg, Merete","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Gerd","key":"christensenpedh","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Gerd","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Mikala","key":"hansbølpedh","last":"Hansbøl","name":"Hansbøl, Mikala","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788776748760"],"pages":"7-19","place":"Odense","publisher":"Syddansk Universitetsforlag","status":"p","title":"On the definition of learning"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","KP","Universities","University Colleges","University of Copenhagen","University of Sout