{"abstract":"The paper presents a science and technology studies and actor-network-theory inspired approach to understanding the development and ongoing re-didactication and re-design of a Danish developed presentation tool called the Theme Board (Tematavlen.dk). It is argued that this approach provides a particularly useful point of departure for engaging in researching innovation and didactic design of digital teaching and learning instruments such as the Theme Board that are programmed and serviced 'in the sky'. I call this approach: constellation-driven innovations.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Hansbøl, Mikala"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-555213"],"filters":{"added":"2023-07","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Brugerdreven innovation","Digitale læremidler","Forskning","læremiddeludvikling"],"level":"sci","oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-AB","DI-UC-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-AB"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"constellations driven innovation","src":["pha"],"src-code":["DI-UC-AB"],"type":"dw","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-555213","ids":["pha-be7ef9b2-9b60-4fee-a8c6-83f5f645cc36"],"keyword":["brugerdreven innovation","digitale læremidler","forskning","konstellationsdreven innovation","læremiddeludvikling"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","noi":["Local-1-1-B16CE46AD6B4153D1059CFA45C32EE4A"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"university college absalon","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-AB","l3nl":"University College Absalon","l3nn":"University College Absalon","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University College Absalon","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen Absalon, Ledelses og Fællesfunktioner (LOF), Forskning og Innovation, Ledelse og fællesfunktioner Sorø"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-AB","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mikala","key":"hansbø